#: exerciseconvert.cpp:393
#: taskview.cpp:323
msgid "You entered a 0 as the denominator. This means division by zero, which is not allowed. This task will be counted as not correctly solved."
msgstr "Escribiu un cero como denominador. Isto significa unha división por cero, o que non está permitido. O exercicio hase contar como incorrecto."

#: exerciseconvert.cpp:399
#: taskview.cpp:329
msgid ""
"You entered the correct result, but not reduced.\n"
"Always enter your results as reduced. This task will be counted as not correctly solved."
msgstr ""
"Escrebiu o resultado correcto, pero non reducido.\n"
"Escriba sempre o resultado reducido. O exercicio hase contar como incorrecto."

