#: mainqtwidget.cpp:104
msgid "Choose another exercise by clicking on an icon."
msgstr "Escolla outro tema premendo nunha icona."

#: mainqtwidget.cpp:105
msgid "Click on the different icons to choose another exercise. The exercises help you to practice different aspects of calculating with fractions."
msgstr "Prema nas diversas iconas para escoller outro tema. Os temas axúdano a practicar varios aspectos do cálculo de fraccións."

